<script setup lang="ts">import {computed} from 'vue';import {fixed} from '../utils/format';const props=defineProps<{result:any}>();const isLog=computed(()=>!!props.result.log_agreement);</script><template><div class="metric-strip"><div><small>Deming 斜率 / 截距（原读数）</small><strong>{{fixed(result.deming.slope,4)}} <em>/ {{fixed(result.deming.intercept)}}</em></strong><span>λ={{result.deming.lambda}} · 不做对数变换</span></div><template v-if="isLog"><div><small>几何均比 Y/X（ln偏倚 {{fixed(result.log_agreement.log_bias,4)}}）</small><strong>{{fixed(result.log_agreement.geometric_mean_ratio,4)}} <em>倍</em></strong><span>对数SD {{fixed(result.log_agreement.log_sample_sd,4)}} · ddof=1</span></div><div><small>比值一致性界限（指数还原）</small><strong>{{fixed(result.log_agreement.ratio_loa_low,4)}} <em>~ {{fixed(result.log_agreement.ratio_loa_high,4)}}</em></strong><span>相对容差 ±{{result.log_agreement.relative_tolerance_pct}}% · 不是置信区间</span></div></template><template v-else><div><small>差值平均偏倚 y−x</small><strong>{{fixed(result.agreement.bias)}} <em>{{result.unit}}</em></strong><span>SD {{fixed(result.agreement.sample_sd)}} · ddof=1</span></div><div><small>一致性界限</small><strong>{{fixed(result.agreement.loa_low,2)}} <em>~ {{fixed(result.agreement.loa_high,2)}}</em></strong><span>不是置信区间</span></div></template></div></template>
